 "remarks": "Light-filled and beautifully refreshed, this charming Glenville residence offers two bedrooms, two full baths, and a thoughtfully designed layout for comfortable everyday living. Recent enhancements include updated flooring, fresh interior paint, and new carpeting. At the heart of the home, the inviting eat-in kitchen features a built-in banquette, creating the perfect setting for casual meals and morning coffee. Outside, an expansive deck overlooks the lush, private backyard, providing an ideal backdrop for outdoor dining, entertaining, or quiet relaxation. Ideally situated moments from the heart of Glenville, with convenient access to local shops, dining, parks, schools, and everything Greenwich has to offer.",
